&lt;h2&gt;
&lt;a class="ltag__user__link" href="/shoaibalimir"&gt;Shoaibali Mir&lt;/a&gt;Follow
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="ltag__user__summary"&gt;
&lt;a class="ltag__user__link" href="/shoaibalimir"&gt;I'm an engineer with 4+ yrs of experience spanning across DevOps, Data, Cloud and AI/ML Engineering Domain. Along with full time work, I'm pursuing Masters Degree in AI/ML from BITS Pilani.&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
